   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">When I try to do the measurement invariance exercise from\r\nthe tutorial using the code <u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">HS.model &lt;- &#39;visual =~ x1 + x2 + x3<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">textual =~ x4 + x5 + x6<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">speed =~ x7 + x8 + x9&#39;<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#007121\">measurementInvariance</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:black\">(HS.model,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#8f2100\">data = </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:black\">HolzingerSwineford1939,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#8f2100\">group = </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:#4071a1\">&quot;school&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:black\">)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:CMTT10;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">I get the following error message.<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">Error\r\nin measurementInvariance(HS.model, data = HolzingerSwineford1939,  : <u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:14.25pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:#c5060b\">  all lavaan() and lavOptions() arguments must\r\nnamed, including the &quot;model=&quot; argument.</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">I wonder why?<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks<u></u><u></u></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Michael<u></u><u></u></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
